      "text": "3.e3 is the usual move order: it supports d4 and prepares Bd3. 3.Nf3 transposes to the regular London, while 3.Nc3 instead of c3 leads to the Rapport-Jobava London. Black's two main plans are ...c5 and ...e6.",
