     "notes": {
      "text": "Black chose the solid ...e6 set-up, usually planning ...Bd6 to castle quickly and offer a trade of your London bishop; in these lines Black's light-squared bishop often struggles to develop. 4.Nf3 continues your plan of sending the knight towards e5. 4.Nd2 is also common; most London move orders are interchangeable.",
